bel><caption><p>Multiple logistic regression to identify risk factors of gallbladder cancer</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-24-481-i006"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>CI, confidence interval; PLG, polypoid lesions of the gallbladder.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T7" position="float"><label>Table 7</label><caption><p>Frequency of malignant polyp according to corresponding number of risk factors, of age, size of PLG and sesile lesion</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jkms-24-481-i007"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>PLG, polypoid lesions of the gallbladder.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>